window.HOME_HTML = "<header class=\"home-top\"><a class=\"logo\" href=\"#\" title=\"Home\"><img src=\"assets/img/shriram-logo.png\" alt=\"Shriram Credit\"></a></header><main class=\"home\"><p class=\"home-kicker\">Shriram Credit \u00b7 Loan Against Mutual Funds</p><h1>LAMF \u2013 LOS Customer Online Journey</h1><p class=\"home-sub\">Product requirements and the clickable prototype of the online loan journey.</p><div class=\"home-ctas\"><a class=\"home-cta\" href=\"#PRD\">Open the PRD document \u2192</a><a class=\"home-cta\" href=\"#SCREENS\">Start the LAMF journey \u2192</a><a class=\"home-cta\" href=\"#COMMS\">Customer communications \u2192</a></div><p class=\"home-contact\">Created by <b>Azhagarsamy Subburaj</b>. For any observation or clarification, please reach out to <a href=\"mailto:azhagarsamy.s@shriramcredit.in\">azhagarsamy.s@shriramcredit.in</a></p></main>";
window.COMMS_HTML = "<a class=\"logo\" href=\"#\" title=\"Home\"><img src=\"assets/img/shriram-logo.png\" alt=\"Shriram Credit\"></a><h1>LAMF \u2013 Customer Communications</h1><p>SMS and mail sent to the customer during the LOS journey (3 communications). Content Structure shows the approved template; Actual Content shows a sample with the variable filled in.</p><div class=\"comms-wrap\"><table class=\"comms\"><thead><tr><th>S.No</th><th>Stage</th><th>Scenarios</th><th>Application</th><th>Communication Type</th><th>Sender</th><th>Content Structure</th><th>Actual Content</th><th>Mail Subject</th><th>SMS Header</th><th>Available</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Enter Mobile Number Page</td><td>After entered the mobile number and user clicking the \u201cContinue\u201d CTA on \u201cEnter your MF linked Mobile Number\u201d page</td><td>LOS</td><td>SMS</td><td>SCCL</td><td>{#numeric#} is your OTP to sign in to Shriram Credit Loan Against Mutual Fund. Do not share this OTP with anyone - Shriram Credit</td><td><u>123456</u> is your OTP to sign in to Shriram Credit Loan Against Mutual Fund. Do not share this OTP with anyone - Shriram Credit</td><td>-</td><td>SGRCDT-T</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Mutual Fund Portfolio fetching in MF Central</td><td>After clicked the \u201cCheck Credit Limit\u201d CTA in \u201cLOS to MF Central Redirection consent page\u201d then in MF central, there is no data available the combination of \u201cmobile number\u201d and \u201cPAN Number\u201d</td><td>LOS</td><td>SMS</td><td>SCCL</td><td>Dear {#alphanumeric#}, No Mutual Fund investments were found for the details you provided. Please verify your credentials and try again - Shriram Credit</td><td>Dear AZHAGARSAMY, No Mutual Fund investments were found for the details you provided. Please verify your credentials and try again - Shriram Credit</td><td>-</td><td>SGRCDT-T</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Applying SCCL\u2019s Eligibility Business Rule Engine (BRE)</td><td>After fetched mutual fund portfolio from MF central then applying SCCL\u2019s eligibility BRE, as per BRE users not eligible</td><td>LOS</td><td>SMS</td><td>SCCL</td><td>Dear {#alphanumeric#}, We regret that your loan request could not be approved per our policy. For assistance, contact our support team - Shriram Credit</td><td>Dear AZHAGARSAMY, We regret that your loan request could not be approved per our policy. For assistance, contact our support team - Shriram Credit</td><td>-</td><td>SGRCDT-T</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"home-contact\">Created by <b>Azhagarsamy Subburaj</b>. For any observation or clarification, please reach out to <a href=\"mailto:azhagarsamy.s@shriramcredit.in\">azhagarsamy.s@shriramcredit.in</a></p>";
